  Isakov
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nThe Pachakuti Mesa Tradition Link-Up is a
  wonderful opportunity to energetically connect in soul presence with the 
 circle of PMT practitioners worldwide\, strengthening the Great Work of ou
 r shamanic planetary tribe. The power that is being harnessed and transmit
 ted is deep and sentient nourishment for our Mother Earth! Learn more abou
 t Link-Up.\n\nPLEASE CONTACT AMY BELOW WITH QUESTIONS OR ZOOM ASSISTANCE:\
 n\nFacilitator: PMT Sanctioned Teacher Amy Isakov\nZoom Link: https://us02
 web.zoom.us/j/87312311978\nContact: AntisuyuCouncil@gmail.com\n***All are 
 welcome!***\n\nCheck the THOTH website calendar often as Link-Ups and othe
 r Pachakuti Mesa Tradition events may be added!
